        "tag_name": "4.8.4",
        "name": "4.8.4",
        "released_at": "2026-07-27T17:54:54.560Z",
        "description": "Changelog : v4.8.4 (76)\\\n\u2022 Rebuilt the interface with modern Jetpack Compose\\\n\u2022 Support for multiple Google accounts\\\n\u2022 User reviews on the app details screen\\\n\u2022 Optional app lock via biometrics or device credentials\\\n\u2022 One-click install for favourites and a buy flow for paid apps\\\n\u2022 Reworked notifications with grouped summaries and settings\\\n\u2022 Revamped updates screen; self-updates now shown in the list\\\n\u2022 More reliable downloads/installs and microG installer support\\\n\u2022 Bug fixes and translation updates\n\n[AuroraStore-4.8.4.apk](/uploads/245eec8867a47057cbc54535f73b32ee/AuroraStore-4.8.4.apk)\n\n[AuroraStore-hw-4.8.4.apk](/uploads/ceb55e58163cf9e2d3f23478f3cf787d/AuroraStore-hw-4.8.4.apk)\n\n[AuroraStore-preload-4.8.4.apk](/uploads/3376fef895820893ddeb7154b056a07e/AuroraStore-preload-4.8.4.apk)",
